#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectdelay.rst:21 0cf804a213954a279f9b664882af9541
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectdelay.rst:23 9adffd1313444d5c83c6e331d1d50fa2
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectDelay creates echo and delay effects by delaying the audio signal and mixing it "
"back with the original. It features two independent delay taps with configurable delay time, "
"level, and panning, plus a feedback loop for creating repeating echoes."
msgstr "**FmodAudioEffectDelay**    提供两个独立 Tap 和一个可选反馈回路。每个 Tap 都可以设置延迟时间、电平和声像，反馈回路则可以设置延迟、电平和低通截止频率。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectdelay.rst:25 6a32b46dc74e4b40a9f4d56c0492f541
msgid "Use this effect to create simple echoes, rhythmic delays, or ambient spaces."
msgstr "用于生成回声、节奏延迟或环境空间感。"

